# === TMEA .gitignore ===
# Principle: the ENGINE and TEMPLATES are tracked (public starter).
# Your LIVE DATA stays local and out of git.

# --- live inputs (real signals, real ClickBank products, feedback) ---
# templates ARE tracked; the live files beside them are not.
inputs/signals.json
inputs/product_catalog.json
inputs/feedback.json

# --- generated output & history ---
daily/*.json
daily/store/
build_log/log.jsonl

# --- cold-store runtime writes (keep the seed files, ignore growth) ---
# (uncomment if your archives accumulate real data you don't want public)
# 02_cold_store/*.yaml

# --- secrets: never commit, even by accident ---
.env
*.key
*_secret*
provider_local.py

# --- python noise ---
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.venv/
venv/
*.egg-info/

# --- editor/OS noise ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.code-workspace
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db